features.description:
@src/file/FilesWatcherWithIndex.ts requires to return the list of files that are in the `filesDir` but also are not ignored by the `ignoredFiles`.
@src/test/TestTools.ts need to use it, so that they can observe the whole provided root directory, but only observe files that are test files.
The current version doesn't work cos it depended on chokidar providing the list of filtered files but that doesn't happen - maybe it can still be fixed to do so.
